{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzled Cube challenges your mind with a gripping, hands-on puzzle experience. Feel the thrill of unraveling complex patterns, the rush of each perfect move, and the satisfaction of mastering the cube. Stay focused, think ahead, and enjoy the journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/c463d741cfc4aeb480904631e6ed8307.gif?t=1742408264\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Puzzled Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzled Cube immerses you in a thrilling test of logic and strategy, where every turn brings you closer to solving the challenge. With each move, you\u2019ll feel the excitement of progress, the tension of near-misses, and the deep satisfaction of finding the perfect solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/ca85badb6f02c7badc57eafc0eab3069.gif?t=1742408264\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay sharp as you push your problem-solving skills to the limit. Whether you take a methodical approach or rely on quick thinking, every solved puzzle delivers a rewarding sense of mastery. Stay focused, stay determined, and conquer the cube!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587280?t=1742408264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587280?t=1742408264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/59917ce8fe3d5ccc8c1bff92dc9540c364dbac70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742408264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/59917ce8fe3d5ccc8c1bff92dc9540c364dbac70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742408264","categories":[{"descriptio